## Session 16: N-Outside-K Loop Order Discovery (claude150-claude164)

### Key Discovery: N-before-K loop ordering improves matmul_1
Swapping the N and K tiling order (N outside K instead of K outside N) places the C output
tile reuse across all K iterations, keeping it in L2. With NC=128, the C tile (128×128×8=128KB)
stays in cache while A and B slices stream through. This improved matmul_1 from 1.49x to 1.44x.

