- 8 K_inner groups per unrolled body (unroll=8)
- 7×8 = 56 redundant intermediate C stores per unrolled iteration
- Accumulators ymm0-7 kept in registers across intermediate stores
- LLVM cannot eliminate stores (writes to live C output matrix)
