--- Batch 73 (Jobs 14095954-14095968, 14095970-14095973, 14095977-14095981, 14095984-14095986) ---
Strategy: Three major new approaches tested:
1. TENSOR-LAND pad+hoist_pad: Hoist A/B packing above K-loop via tensor.pad + hoist_pad
2. promote-before-K: Promote A before K-tiling (1 copy per forall tile vs per K iteration)
3. loop-versioning-licm: LLVM pass for runtime alias-checked loop versioning

KEY INNOVATION: Two-phase pipeline (run_twophase.py + run.sh -twophase):
  Phase 1: tensor-land schedule (pad+hoist) via mlir-opt on tensor IR
  Phase 2: bufferize via mlir-opt, then memref-land schedule (tile+vectorize) via run_twophase.py
  Solves: enables tensor.pad + hoist_pad which only work on tensor IR

