SESSION 73: K=1+Unroll, Vector Lowering, NUMA, Pipeline
============================================================

--- K=1 + Unroll Experiments (Batch 81: jobs 14097019-14097031) ---

IR Analysis reveals K=1+unroll is STRUCTURALLY INFERIOR to K=8 vectorize:
- K=8 vectorize: C loaded 4x, stored 4x per K-block (SSA chains keep C in regs)
- K=1+unroll8: C loaded 32x, stored 32x per K-block (each unrolled copy is independent)
- A loads: K=8 uses vector<8xf64>, K=1 uses vector<1xf64> (scalar loads)

Results (all same-node compared):
1. claude1549_2 (K=1 no unroll, m2) fpc+postRA: 535/379 = 1.411x — NEUTRAL
2. claude1550_2 (K=1+unroll8, m2) standard: 537/378 = 1.420x — NEUTRAL  
