4. claude1551_2 (K=1+unroll16, m2) standard: 1001/379 = 2.641x — CATASTROPHIC
5. claude1554_2 (K=1+unroll4, m2) standard: 567/381 = 1.486x — WORSE
6. claude1555_2 (unroll_and_jam M×2, m2): 892/380 = 2.348x — MUCH WORSE
