=== Session 80: Block-Pack Matmul & Vector Lowering Flags ===

Block-Pack Matmul (linalg-block-pack-matmul):
- Converts matmul to 6D generic with pack/unpack operations
- Pack: tensor.expand_shape + linalg.transpose (data layout transform)
- 6D generic: (MB, NB, KB, mr, nr, kr) with contraction on KB and kr
- FUNDAMENTAL PROBLEM: 6D structure produces vector.reduction (dot products)
  not vector.outerproduct — horizontal adds are 10-20x slower than FMA on AVX2
- Pipeline bugs encountered and fixed:
  1. Python Context must stay alive through PassManager.run
  2. ub.poison: convert-vector-to-scf must run BEFORE vector-to-llvm
  3. convert-vector-to-scf must run BEFORE convert-scf-to-openmp (avoids index cast issues)
  4. Pass option syntax: use {full-unroll=true} not "full-unroll=true" in textual pipeline
- Results: 17-29x PyTorch (CATASTROPHICALLY SLOW)
- Block-pack approach ABANDONED

